Package: nomnowcast
Title: Nowcasting Australian Net Overseas Migration
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Project", "Maintainer", email = "maintainer@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reproducible R pipeline for nowcasting quarterly Australian Net
    Overseas Migration (NOM) using only publicly available data. Combines
    Overseas Arrivals and Departures, Department of Home Affairs visa
    grants, Department of Education student enrolments and BITRE airline
    activity with state-space and Bayesian hierarchical models, under a
    vintage-aware backtesting framework.
